{
  "name": "Live Reviews",
  "description": "The Monday live-commerce review an agent writes from the records above: GMV against target, which sessions slipped and why, what goes live this week without stock.",
  "position": 3,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "write-review",
      "label": {
        "en": "Write this Monday’s live review",
        "zh-CN": "写本周一的直播周报"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-live-commerce` skill in this folder and follow it. Write the live review for last Monday to Sunday from the sessions, signals and actions: a one-line headline, GMV in the week against target, how many sessions are on track, every at-risk session with what went wrong and the action, every session going live in the next 7 days without its stock, and what changed since last week. Save it as a draft.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-live-commerce` Skill，按它的规则做。根据场次、信号和跟进措施，写上周一到周日的直播周报：一句话结论、本周 GMV 对比目标、顺利场次数、每场有风险的直播出了什么问题和对应措施、未来 7 天要开播但还没备好货的场次、与上周相比的变化。保存为草稿。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "compare-weeks",
      "label": {
        "en": "What got better or worse since last week?",
        "zh-CN": "和上周比哪些变好了、哪些变差了"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-live-commerce` skill in this folder and follow it. Compare the two latest reviews and the signals between them: GMV, which sessions changed status, how the at-risk count moved, and which actions closed. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-live-commerce` Skill，按它的规则做。对比最近两份周报和期间的信号：GMV、哪些场次换了状态、有风险场次数怎么变、哪些跟进措施完成了。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
